name: service
description: >-
  Create a JRebirth Service for slow, external, backend, or integration work
  (REST, DB gateway, file import/export, heavy computation). Use to keep long
  work out of Model, View, and Controller.
---
# Create Service

Service does long-running or external work, off the UI logic.

## Use when

Work is slow, external, backend-facing, or integration-heavy:

- REST client call
- Spring bridge call
- file import or export
- report generation
- expensive computation

## Keep out

- visual node building
- trivial UI event handling

## Key API

- split into an interface plus a `DefaultService` implementation, registered with `@Register(value = FooService.class)`.
- expose `WaveItem<T>` and `WaveType` constants on the interface for typed payloads.
- name action methods `doXxx(payload, Wave)` so they bind to waves.
- return results or send a result wave; never touch the scene graph directly.

Template: `templates/ServiceTemplate.java.txt`.
